OL,3,GNEWSAEndangered crayfish released at
OL,4,Asafe site
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of endangered white-clawed
OL,7,Fcrayfish have been released at a safe
OL,8,Fsite.
OL,10,FNorthumberland Zoo's conservation
OL,11,Fproject saw 348 craylings reared in "a
OL,12,Fcomplex journey" which involved
OL,13,F"specialist daily care, careful
OL,14,Fmonitoring of water quality and plenty
OL,15,Fof problem solving".
OL,17,FThe craylings were released into what
OL,18,Fis called an ark site - a special patch
OL,19,Fwhere they have more protection to help
OL,20,Fthem live and breed in safety - near
OL,21,Fthe River Wansbeck, a stronghold for
OL,22,Fthe native crayfish.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
