OL,3,GNEWSAEndangered crayfish released at
OL,4,Asafe site
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite-clawed crayfish were once common
OL,7,Fbut populations have declined by an
OL,8,Festimated 70 to 80% in recent decades
OL,9,Fdue to pollution, habitat loss, and the
OL,10,Fspread of invasive non-native species.
